    "name": "Texas Instruments Product Information Financial Shipments API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Texas Instruments Product Information API provides programmatic access to TI's product catalog, including part details, parametric data, quality and reliability information. Two variants are available: the standard API (multiple endpoint calls, higher rate limit) and the orchestrated API (single endpoint call, lower rate limit). Authentication uses OAuth 2.0 client credentials flow.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Texas Instruments API Support",
